```go
func (in *Inspector) Len() int {
	n := 0
	for i, ev := range in.events {
		if ev.index > int32(i) {
			n++
		}
	}
	return n
}
```

This counts only push events (where `ev.index > i`), which correspond one-to-one with the non-nil AST nodes `ast.Inspect` visits.

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector_test.go`** — added `TestLen`, which constructs an inspector and compares `Len()` against the count from `ast.Inspect`.

